@startuml D21-GitHub-Actions-Pipeline
title D21 — GitHub Actions CI Pipeline\n(.github/workflows/ci.yml)

skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #DAE8FC
skinparam activityBorderColor #6C8EBF

|Trigger|
start
:push to main\nOR pull_request to main;

|GitHub Actions Runner\n(ubuntu-latest)|
:actions/checkout@v4\n(clone repository);

:docker build -t parallel-mlp .\n[Multi-stage build:\n Stage 1 → compile all binaries\n Stage 2 → slim runtime image];

note right
  Builder stage compiles:
  - build/train_seq
  - build/train_omp
  - build/train_mpi
  using g++ and mpicxx.
end note

:Download MNIST Dataset\ndocker run parallel-mlp\n  bash scripts/download_mnist.sh\ndocker cp mnist-download:/app/data/mnist/raw\n  ./data/mnist/raw;

note right
  IDX binary files downloaded
  into GitHub runner's workspace.
end note

:Run Unit Tests\ndocker run -v …/data/mnist/raw:/app/data/mnist/raw:ro\n  parallel-mlp make test;

note right
  Runs: test_dataset, test_loss,
  test_metrics, test_mlp,
  test_optimizer, test_utils.
  Exit code 1 fails the job.
end note

:Run Quick Validation Benchmark\ndocker run -v …data:ro -v …/results:/app/results\n  parallel-mlp bash scripts/test_benchmark.sh;

note right
  1-epoch benchmark:
  Sequential + OpenMP(2) + MPI(2)
  on test_benchmark.conf.
  Output: results/tables/benchmark_test.csv
end note

|Upload Artifact|
:actions/upload-artifact@v4\nname: benchmark-results\npath: results/\nretention-days: 30;

note right
  Runs even if previous steps fail
  (if: always()).
  Allows inspection of partial results
  on failure.
end note

stop

@enduml
